        <mxCell id="z8zCeddA12LdAuNvtdug-17" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;size=26;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;token_budget = self.max_num_scheduled_tokens &amp;nbsp; # 默认 = max_num_batched_tokens&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: normal; margin: 0px 0px 16px;&quot;&gt;这是&quot;资源预算&quot;。这一轮调度就是一个&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;装箱问题&lt;/span&gt;：&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; white-space: normal; padding-inline-start: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px;&quot;&gt;每给一个请求分配&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;vscode-katex-container&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 1.21em; line-height: 1.2; font-family: KaTeX_Main, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-mathml&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px; clip: rect(1px, 1px, 1px, 1px); height: 1px; overflow: hidden; padding: 0px; position: absolute; width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;math&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;mi&gt;n&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.4306em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-family: KaTeX_Math; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 个 token，就 &lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 10.998px; padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 4px; border: 3px rgb(140, 140, 140); white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;token_budget -= n&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px;&quot;&gt;预算耗尽（&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 10.998px; padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 4px; border: 3px rgb(140, 140, 140); white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;token_budget &amp;lt;= 0&lt;/code&gt;）就退出循环，剩下的等下一步&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;margin: 4px 0px;&quot;&gt;所以长 prompt 会被切成 &lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 10.998px; padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 4px; border: 3px rgb(140, 140, 140); white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;num_new_tokens = min(num_new_tokens, token_budget)&lt;/code&gt; 一块一块算 —— 这就是 &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;chunked prefill。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;另外它也是&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;抢占的导火索&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: transparent; font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 10.998px; padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 4px; border: 3px rgb(140, 140, 140);&quot;&gt;allocate_slots&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe WPC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; 失败说明 KV block 不够了，就要抢占别的请求腾地方。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="215" width="770" x="11406" y="-4496" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
